OL,3,GNEWSAYouth charged after shopping
OL,4,Acentre attack leaves teenager in
OL,5,Ahospital
OL,6,
OL,7,FA teenager has been charged after an
OL,8,Fattack involving a groups of youths
OL,9,Finside a Glasgow shopping centre left
OL,10,Fanother teenager needing hospital
OL,11,Ftreatment.
OL,13,FVideo posted on social media shows a
OL,14,Fyoung man, who was using a crutch and
OL,15,Fwearing a medical boot, being knocked
OL,16,Fto the ground, then repeatedly punched
OL,17,Fand kicked inside the St Enoch Centre
OL,18,Fon Friday afternoon.
OL,20,FA second person was also pushed to the
OL,21,Fground during the disturbance but
OL,22,Fsecurity staff intervened.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
